Package: fomo
Type: Package
Title: Mislabel Correction in Multi-Omic Datasets
Version: 0.99.0
Description: An R package to automatically detect and correct mislabeled samples 
    in multi-omic datasets that have multiple samples per individual. Provides functions 
    for solving, visualizing, and outputting sample mislabel information.
